    },
    {
      "claim": "Casodex L2 records show dose-dependent bioavailability (72-100% at 1 mg/kg, 10-12% at 250 mg/kg), illustrating solubility-limited absorption for lipophilic compounds, but they concern a non-steroidal antiandrogen and do not provide affirmative evidence for the query.",
      "card_ids": ["C50", "C72", "C89", "C63", "C78"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "The query is a neutral lipophilic steroid (logP 4.14) with a phenol and tertiary alcohol; the phenol is a conjugation liability and the high logP with no ionization at pH 7.4 suggests dissolution limits, consistent with the low-F pattern of the transferable steroid contexts.",
      "card_ids": ["C70", "C64", "C03", "C13"]
    }
